<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Wing Fai shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Wing Fai shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of civil engineering concern Wing Fai International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares closed HK$0.02 lower at HK$0.53 per share on Friday on volume of 7.46 million shares.</p>
<p>Wing Fai repairs and maintains civil engineering establishments and buildings in the public sector.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
